# Hand-judged state of the cutoff export of the cutoff scope (manifest cutoff.scope / cutoff.event): one row per attempt
# that exists at the cutoff. Executions and attempts not listed must be absent from that export (m-correct a2, m-twin-ko).
# A later correction never changes a sample exported as of an earlier cutoff (contract v1 section 12): m-correct a1 is
# still COMPLETED at revision 1 and m-correct has no outcome yet.
# execution | ordinal | result at cutoff | finish revision at cutoff (- when unfinished) | accepted attempt (y/n) | label at cutoff | acceptance at cutoff
m-repair|1|FAILED|1|n|SUCCESS|VALIDATED_ACCEPTED
m-repair|2|COMPLETED|1|y|SUCCESS|VALIDATED_ACCEPTED
m-abandon|1|CANCELLED|1|n|SUCCESS|VALIDATED_ACCEPTED
m-abandon|2|COMPLETED|1|y|SUCCESS|VALIDATED_ACCEPTED
m-chain3|1|FAILED|1|n|SUCCESS|VALIDATED_ACCEPTED
m-chain3|2|FAILED|1|n|SUCCESS|VALIDATED_ACCEPTED
m-chain3|3|COMPLETED|1|y|SUCCESS|VALIDATED_ACCEPTED
m-unfinished|1|FAILED|1|n|UNLABELED|PENDING
m-unfinished|2|UNFINISHED|-|n|UNLABELED|PENDING
m-twin-ok|1|COMPLETED|1|y|SUCCESS|VALIDATED_ACCEPTED
m-correct|1|COMPLETED|1|n|UNLABELED|PENDING
